Apple is working on a high-end <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/macbook-pro/">MacBook Pro</a> that could be called the "MacBook Ultra." The device will have several firsts in a Mac, including an OLED display and a touchscreen.<br/>
<br/>
